  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1108.02 General Procedure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1108.02 General Procedure.\n\n(a) The department shall prepare an environmental review report for the applicant’s proposed project based on the information submitted by the applicant pursuant to Env-Dw 1106.05.\n\n(b) The environmental review shall result in one of the following:\n\n(1) A categorical exclusion (CE);\n\n(2) A finding of no significant impact (FONSI); or\n\n(3) A requirement for the applicant to prepare an environmental impact statement (EIS).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Dw 1100) #13160, eff 1-20-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1100.html"
